do_2 = "For the terminal-transition case in agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/protocol_evidence_native_tests.rs, establish from the assertion which transition the daemon actually produces and repair agent/crates/layerx-agentd/src/protocol_evidence.rs so the complete maintained transition is required and produced; do not relax the assertion."
do_3 = "For the confirmed-creation case in agent/crates/layerx-agentd/tests/budget_create.rs, establish why the core-keyed budget is not returned or is cached on trust, and repair the creation path in the daemon so the confirmed creation returns the core-keyed budget without caching on trust."
